Instructions

Karo CRM Tracker Updater

Convert raw sponsor research, call notes, and deal updates into standardized CSV or Markdown tables for the #Karo sponsor pipeline.

When to Use

When adding new sponsor leads to the pipeline.
When updating deal stages after discovery calls or proposal submissions.
When exporting pipeline summaries to Google Sheets or GitHub trackers.
Pipeline Schema

Ensure every record adheres to the standardized 12-field schema:

Organisation: Brand name
Category: Title / Kit / Zone / In-Kind / CSR
Lead Owner: Assigned team member
Contact Name & Role: Decision maker details
Channel: Email / LinkedIn / Warm Intro
Total Value: Cash + In-Kind estimated value
Stage: Researching -> First Contact -> Discovery -> Proposal Sent -> Negotiation -> Confirmed -> Fulfilled
Payment Status: Pending Invoice / Paid 100% / In-Kind Delivered
Last Contact Date: Date of last interaction
Next Action: Concrete next step
Next Action Date: Strict deadline (respecting Nov 6-15 blackout)
Notes: Specific product integration or CSR notes
